"Follow these instructions to download the radio memory:\n"
"1 - Turn off your radio\n"
"2 - Connect your interface cable\n"
"3 - Turn on your radio, volume @ 50%\n"
"4 - CHIRP Menu - Radio - Download from radio\n"
